  <div class="card">
    <h2>Server power</h2>
    <div class="status"><span class="dot" id="dot"></span><span class="big" id="pstate">…</span></div>
    <div class="note" id="pnote"></div>
    <div class="btns">
      <button class="act primary" onclick="ov(12)">Keep awake tonight</button>
      <button class="act" onclick="ov(0)">Cancel override</button>
    </div>
    <div class="note"><b>This does not hold the wall timer open.</b>
    It only stops the server shutting itself down. If the physical timer is
    still armed, power is cut anyway — switch it off too.</div>
